<title>JAPAN: Keihin Express Rail to issue 40 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Keihin Express Rail to issue 40 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Keihin Electric Express Railway Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   19	 AMT   40 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Mar.09</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 2.Dec.96   CONV TO 30.Mar.09</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 11.Nov.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 5.Nov-8.Nov</p>
<p> LAST JCR   A	   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on November 1.</p>
</text>
